export anchor BullionStyle:
    number: 370
    screen: FinanceBudget
    name: Bullion
    idea: Savings shown as real weight, gold ingots on deep burgundy velvet, balances stamped on trapezoid bars, the goal as a pyramid of ten 500 euro bars filling from the bottom, and budget lines as ingot shaped meters.
    base: dark
    palette:
        velvet: #1a0910, the page and the style sheet, with faint plush glows
        plush: #2a1019, panels, fields and rows
        plushTwo: #3a1724, the owed card bar, the partly filled ingot and the secondary button
        seam: #5c2a3a, panel edges and row rules
        ink: #f6e9e0, text
        muted: #d0b3ad, labels, dates and empty bar outlines
        gold: #d8aa3e, ingot bodies, meters, the current nav item and the primary button
        goldHigh: #f4d67e, ingot shine, headings, focus and money in
        goldLow: #a87a22, the ingot shadow edge
        onGold: #2a1600, text stamped on gold
        rose: #ff9fa8, over budget hatching and the owed balance
        paleGold: #e9d58a, the in reserve status
    type:
        Labels use Optima, Candara, Segoe UI, Gill Sans, Trebuchet MS, often in
        caps tracked .2em or more. Figures use Rockwell, Roboto Slab, DejaVu
        Serif, Georgia. The goal figure is 40px slab at 700 in gold high, ingot
        figures 32px slab at 700 on gold, headings 16px caps tracked .24em at
        700, body 17px and status 13px caps tracked .1em.
    layout:
        A 1180px page. The header has a gold coin seal, Brightwork Money in
        tracked gold caps and Mara Okafor with October holdings in euros on the
        right, ruled below by a seam, then caps nav with Overview on a gold
        block. A centred tracked line reads October, what you hold. Three
        trapezoid ingots follow in a row, Everyday account and Savings in
        shining gold with dark stamped text, and the Credit card as a dark plush
        ingot with the figure in rose and a clock with Owed, due 12 Nov. Below,
        a wide October spending panel lists five tiers, each with the name, an
        ingot shaped meter with slanted ends filled in gold, spent of limit and
        a caps status under the meter, Eating out filled with rose diagonal
        hatching. A totals line reads spent 1,870 of 1,930 and 60 still in
        reserve. A 420px Japan trip bars panel shows a pyramid of ten trapezoid
        bars, four, three, two and one, six solid and stamped 500, the seventh
        two fifths gold behind a dashed outline, three dashed empties, then
        3,200 of 5,000, what is left and the target. Deposits and withdrawals
        runs full width below. Below 1000px panels stack, below 680px ingots
        stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 24px panel padding, 20px between ingots, 32px between panels.
    density: Medium. Three ingots, five tiers, a ten bar pyramid and five movements.
    corners: Trapezoid ingot cuts on balances, meters and swatches. 4px panels and 2px buttons.
    borders: A 1px inset seam round panels and between rows, and a double gold focus ring.
    shadows: Deep, 0 20px 40px black under panels so they sit on the velvet.
    icons:
        Gold bars are the main icon. Status pairs an outline circle check, ruled
        square or triangle with words, and the over meter swaps gold for rose
        hatching. Arrows mark deposits and withdrawals.
    focus: A 3px double pale gold outline offset 4px.
    tone:
        Weighty and proud, such as What you hold, Fine, in reserve, Fully spent
        and Over by 62.
